WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.419 --> 00:00:14.520
Wukong returned from the Land of Darkness.

2
00:00:18.061 --> 00:00:20.441
Lady Kou brought the travelers back to her house.

3
00:00:22.062 --> 00:00:25.603
Inside the coffin the squire's body was gray and lifeless.

4
00:00:26.563 --> 00:00:29.484
Wukong leaned over the coffin and recited a spell.

5
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:34.462
Lady Kou gasped as color returned to her husband's face.

6
00:00:34.482 --> 00:00:38.565
"It's working!"

7
00:00:38.845 --> 00:00:39.525
said Wujing.

8
00:00:39.545 --> 00:00:41.886
"The squire is coming back to life!"

9
00:00:42.186 --> 00:00:43.127
said the Tang Monk.

10
00:00:43.147 --> 00:00:45.468
[g@Bajie licked his lips.

11
00:00:46.149 --> 00:00:52.852
"Maybe the squire will thank us with a big feast."@g] [g@Squire Kou sat up and smiled.

12
00:00:52.872 --> 00:00:59.096
"Thank you, Wukong."@g] He climbed out of the coffin and turned to his wife.

13
00:01:00.012 --> 00:01:01.633
[g@Tears filled her eyes.

14
00:01:02.153 --> 00:01:11.557
The two embraced.@g] That night Squire and Lady Kou held a feast to thank Wukong.

15
00:01:12.638 --> 00:01:16.739
And the next morning they let the travelers leave without any argument.

16
00:01:16.759 --> 00:01:19.240
"Good luck!"

17
00:01:19.541 --> 00:01:21.421
called Lady Kou as they departed.

18
00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:26.944
The Tang Monk and his companions traveled for many more months.

19
00:01:28.164 --> 00:01:33.107
Through rain and snow, heat and cold, they slowly continued west.

20
00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:39.132
One day the road went into a beautiful land.

21
00:01:41.093 --> 00:01:43.575
There were flowers and magnificent trees.

22
00:01:44.996 --> 00:01:47.577
People smiled at the travelers and offered food.

23
00:01:47.597 --> 00:01:51.240
[g@The Tang Monk stared in amazement.

24
00:01:51.980 --> 00:01:56.904
"What is this place?"@g] "We are in the West," said Wukong.

25
00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:00.142
"We are very close to the Western Paradise."

26
00:02:01.563 --> 00:02:04.024
A woman held out a basket of plums.

27
00:02:04.044 --> 00:02:06.746
[g@Bajie scooped up a handful.

28
00:02:06.766 --> 00:02:15.693
"I love this place."@g] [g@"Look up ahead," said Wujing, pointing to a row of tall buildings.@g] "It's an

29
00:02:15.833 --> 00:02:19.736
abbey." The road led through a large gate in the abbey.

30
00:02:19.756 --> 00:02:25.440
[g@At the gate the monk got down from his horse.

31
00:02:27.336 --> 00:02:32.179
A young man greeted them.@g] "Are you the Tang Monk?"

32
00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:33.160
asked the man.

33
00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:35.462
[g@"Yes," said the monk.

34
00:02:36.162 --> 00:02:39.805
He waved toward the rest of the group.@g] "And these are my companions."

35
00:02:41.105 --> 00:02:42.546
[g@"You've finally arrived!"

36
00:02:43.247 --> 00:02:48.811
The man laughed.@g] "I was starting to think that the bodhisattva Guanyin had tricked me.

37
00:02:49.691 --> 00:02:51.612
She told me you would arrive in a year or so.

38
00:02:52.593 --> 00:02:54.174
But that was over ten years ago!"

39
00:02:54.194 --> 00:02:56.556
[g@The Tang Monk bowed.

40
00:02:56.972 --> 00:02:57.492
"Forgive me.

41
00:02:58.553 --> 00:03:03.236
I wanted to arrive much sooner.@g] But we faced many dangers and delays along the way."

42
00:03:03.256 --> 00:03:06.037
[g@Bajie snorted.

43
00:03:06.057 --> 00:03:12.101
"And this place wasn't very easy to find either."@g] [g@The man smiled.

44
00:03:12.121 --> 00:03:18.264
"There is no need to apologize.@g] I'm the Great Immortal of the Golden Head, and this abbey is

45
00:03:18.304 --> 00:03:18.804
my home.

46
00:03:19.865 --> 00:03:21.966
Beyond it lies the Western Paradise.

47
00:03:23.007 --> 00:03:24.868
Come inside and rest before you continue."

48
00:03:30.072 --> 00:03:35.215
Servants filled tubs with warm, perfumed water, and the travelers took baths.

49
00:03:35.235 --> 00:03:39.617
[g@"It feels good to get clean," said Bajie.

50
00:03:39.637 --> 00:03:45.160
"I haven't had a bath in months."@g] [g@Wukong laughed.

51
00:03:45.921 --> 00:03:52.504
"Now we won't have to cover our noses when you're near!"@g] Bajie snorted and splashed water at Wukong.

52
00:03:52.524 --> 00:03:54.805
[g@The monkey splashed back.

53
00:03:56.026 --> 00:04:04.180
Everyone laughed.@g] After their baths the Tang Monk put on the Buddhist robe Guanyuin had given him.

54
00:04:05.281 --> 00:04:08.725
Then the travelers enjoyed a large meal with the immortal.

55
00:04:09.886 --> 00:04:14.630
Servants brought trays loaded with noodles, vegetables, tofu, and steamed buns.

56
00:04:20.416 --> 00:04:24.720
In the morning the immortal led the group out the back door of the abbey.

57
00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:30.403
The road continued west, through a land even more beautiful and magical.

58
00:04:31.604 --> 00:04:35.367
Birds sang as animals leaped playfully through the flowers.

59
00:04:37.808 --> 00:04:40.250
Brilliant light sparkled on everything.

60
00:04:40.270 --> 00:04:44.713
[g@In the distance stood a huge mountain.

61
00:04:45.634 --> 00:04:51.318
Its peak was hidden by clouds.@g] The Tang Monk stared silently at the mountain.

62
00:04:52.278 --> 00:04:54.580
Wukong put his hand on the monk's shoulder.

63
00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:57.242
"That's the Spirit Mountain, Master.

64
00:04:58.383 --> 00:04:59.964
We're almost at the end of our journey."

65
00:05:01.325 --> 00:05:03.627
A smile spread across the monk's face.

66
00:05:04.688 --> 00:05:06.489
The travelers thanked the immortal.

67
00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:10.573
Filled with energy now, they hurried down the road.

68
00:05:11.573 --> 00:05:15.076
The steep slopes of the Spirit Mountain towered over them.
